## 3. Typography

Font family: **Space Grotesk** — same as web. Bundle via `expo-font` or `@expo-google-fonts/space-grotesk`. Apply to all text elements globally via root Text component.

### Type Scale

| Role | Size (pt/sp) | Weight | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| `heroBalance` | 40pt | 700 Bold | Portfolio total on HomeScreen |
| `display` | 32pt | 700 Bold | Major screen titles |
| `title1` | 26pt | 700 Bold | Section headers |
| `title2` | 22pt | 600 SemiBold | Card titles, modal headers |
| `title3` | 20pt | 600 SemiBold | Sub-section headers |
| `headline` | 17pt | 600 SemiBold | List row labels |
| `body` | 16pt | 400 Regular | Primary body text |
| `callout` | 15pt | 400 Regular | Supporting body text |
| `subhead` | 14pt | 400 Regular | Secondary labels |
| `footnote` | 13pt | 400 Regular | Metadata, timestamps |
| `caption` | 12pt | 400 Regular | Smallest label text |

Rules:
- **Minimum font size: 12pt** — never go below this.
- **Input fields: minimum 16pt** (prevents iOS auto-zoom on focus).
- **All sizes in `sp`-equivalent** — React Native font sizes scale with system settings.
- **Gradient text** (screen titles): Use `expo-linear-gradient` with `MaskedView` — replicate web gradient text pattern.
- **Currency amounts**: Always use tabular figures (monospace-style number alignment) where available.

