## 13. Deep Links

All deep links use the scheme `unera://`. Every notification and email must deep-link to the relevant screen.

| Route | Deep Link | Screen |
|---|---|---|
| Home | `unera://home` | HomeScreen |
| Transaction detail | `unera://transaction/[txId]` | TransactionDetailScreen |
| Centre detail | `unera://centre/[centreId]` | CentreDetailScreen |
| Donate to centre | `unera://donate/[centreId]` | DonateScreen |
| Password reset | `unera://reset?token=[token]` | PasswordResetScreen |
| Email verify | `unera://verify?token=[token]` | VerifyEmailScreen |
| Receive (with amount) | `unera://receive?amount=[amount]` | ReceiveScreen |

Handle all deep links in a root `DeepLinkHandler` component that intercepts the URL and routes via `expo-router`.

