## 14. Onboarding & Empty States

### Onboarding Slides (First Launch)
- 3 slides, horizontally swipeable, with pagination dots
- Each slide: full-screen gradient background + centered illustration + large title + 1-sentence body
- Slide 1 — "Hold Value": gradient-primary background — "Your money, stable and secure."
- Slide 2 — "Give Automatically": gradient-warm background — "Every dollar you hold does good."
- Slide 3 — "Grow Together": gradient-sky background — "Your impact, tracked in real time."
- Skip button: top-right, always visible. "Get Started" on final slide.
- Auto-advance: no — users must swipe or tap Next

### Empty States
Every list screen must have a designed empty state (not a blank screen):

| Screen | Empty State Message | CTA |
|---|---|---|
| Transaction history | "No transactions yet" + wallet illustration | "Add Money" button |
| Donation history | "You haven't donated yet" + heart illustration | "Explore Centres" button |
| Notifications | "You're all caught up" + bell illustration | None |
| Explore Centres (no results) | "No centres match your search" + globe illustration | Clear filters |

Empty state illustration style: simple 2-color line art using UNERA brand colors. Max 120×120pt.

