### 16.13 What NOT to Do — Icons & Media

- ❌ **No external icon libraries** (Lucide, Heroicons npm package, Font Awesome, Phosphor, Tabler) — use the SVG paths listed in this section directly
- ❌ **No emoji as icons** — use SVG equivalents from Section 16.12
- ❌ **No third-party avatar services** — text initials only until user uploads a photo
- ❌ **No substituting wallet provider logos** — MetaMask, WalletConnect, Coinbase, Brave, and Ledger must use the exact brand SVG paths from Section 16.9
- ❌ **No different photos for the Humanity Centres** — use the exact Unsplash URLs from Section 16.10
- ❌ **No rasterized PNG/JPG icons** for UI icons — SVG/vector only for all iconography
- ❌ **No hardcoded icon colors** — always apply color via `colors.*` token from `theme.ts` or `stroke="currentColor"` inherited from the parent
